{"id":"takzhe","lemma":"также","pos":"adv","rank":265,"glosses":["also, too, as well, likewise","either, neither, nor"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B6%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я также это сделаю.","en":"I'll do it, too.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Мы также нашли это.","en":"We also found this.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Том также учитель?","en":"Is Tom also a teacher?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"teacher, instructor"}]},{"text":"Это также и мои деньги.","en":"It's my money, too.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"У меня также есть дочь.","en":"I also have a daughter.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"daughter"}]}]}